OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died on Orwell Bridge is
OL,4,Anamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have named a man who died in a
OL,7,Fcollision on the Orwell Bridge.
OL,9,FSuffolk officers were called by the
OL,10,Fambulance service at 03:41 BST on 16
OL,11,FOctober to reports of a person on the
OL,12,Fwestbound carriageway of the bridge.
OL,14,FEmergency services attended and the man
OL,15,F- named as 18-year-old Joel Sousa - was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FFormal identification procedures have
OL,19,Fnot yet taken place but the family has
OL,20,Fbeen informed. Officers are continuing
OL,21,Fto appeal for any witnesses.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
